    "id": "guion-11",
    "titulo": "AD 08 · POV: vuelta a casa después del parque",
    "html": "<section id=\"guion-11\" style=\"background:#FAF6EE;color:#211714;font-family:Figtree, Arial, sans-serif;padding:120px 128px 160px;display:flex;flex-direction:column\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:36px\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:40px\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px\"><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B5F58\">Guion 11 de 11 · AD 08</p><h2 style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:60px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-2px\">POV: vuelta a casa después del parque</h2></div><p style=\"font-family:'Gochi Hand', 'Brush Script MT', cursive;font-size:28px;line-height:1.2;text-transform:uppercase;text-align:center;background:#C5F1AB;padding:10px 24px;border-radius:999px;transform:rotate(3deg);white-space:nowrap\">Andrea a cámara · 20–30 s</p></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:12px;align-items:stretch\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;background:#F1ECE3;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:14px\"><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B5F58;white-space:nowrap\">Dónde</p><p style=\"font-size:21px;line-height:1.3\">Parque de perros, al atardecer</p></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;background:#F1ECE3;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:14px\"><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B5F58;white-space:nowrap\">Quién</p><p style=\"font-size:21px;line-height:1.3\">Andrea con los perros, en selfie</p></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;background:#F1ECE3;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:14px\"><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B5F58;white-space:nowrap\">Material</p><p style=\"font-size:21px;line-height:1.3\">Correa, bolsa de snacks del súper, bolsa de Barkita empezada</p></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px 1fr 500px;gap:28px;padding-bottom:10px\"><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B5F58\">Tiempo</p><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B5F58\">Lo que se dice</p><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B5F58\">Lo que se ve</p></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;border-bottom:2px solid #211714\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px 1fr 500px;gap:28px;align-items:center;padding:16px 0;border-top:2px solid #211714\"><p style=\"font-family:'Titan One', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;font-size:26px;line-height:1.2\">0–3 s</p><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:32px;line-height:1.25;background:#C5F1AB;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:12px;\">«No le voy a dar más estos snacks a [nombre].»</p><p style=\"font-size:24px;line-height:1.35;color:#4A3F3A\">Selfie paseando con el perro</p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px 1fr 500px;gap:28px;align-items:center;padding:16px 0;border-top:2px solid #211714\"><p style=\"font-family:'Titan One', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;font-size:26px;line-height:1.2\">3–10 s</p><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:32px;line-height:1.25;\">«Me han explicado que son puro ultraprocesado.»</p><p style=\"font-size:24px;line-height:1.35;color:#4A3F3A\">Enseña la bolsa del súper</p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px 1fr 500px;gap:28px;align-items:center;padding:16px 0;border-top:2px solid #211714\"><p style=\"font-family:'Titan One', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;font-size:26px;line-height:1.2\">10–18 s</p><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:32px;line-height:1.25;\">«Ahora le doy estos: deshidratados y de un solo ingrediente.»</p><p style=\"font-size:24px;line-height:1.35;color:#4A3F3A\">Saca la bolsa de Barkita empezada</p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px 1fr 500px;gap:28px;align-items:center;padding:16px 0;border-top:2px solid #211714\"><p style=\"font-family:'Titan One', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;font-size:26px;line-height:1.2\">18–24 s</p><p style=\"font-family:'Gochi Hand', 'Brush Script MT', cursive;font-size:28px;line-height:1.3;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B5F58\">Sin voz</p><p style=\"font-size:24px;line-height:1.35;color:#4A3F3A\">Le da uno en un banco</p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px 1fr 500px;gap:28px;align-items:center;padding:16px 0;border-top:2px solid #211714\"><p style=\"font-family:'Titan One', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;font-size:26px;line-height:1.2\">24–28 s</p><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:32px;line-height:1.25;\">«Si lees tus etiquetas, lee también las suyas.»</p><p style=\"font-size:24px;line-height:1.35;color:#4A3F3A\">Selfie de cierre</p></div></div></div></div><img src=\"/pitch/barkita/logo-h-cacao.png\" alt=\"Barkita\" style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;bottom:66px;width:150px;height:24px;object-fit:contain\"><p style=\"position:absolute;left:300px;bottom:62px;width:900px;font-size:24px;line-height:1.2;color:#6B5F58\">Guión Rodaje 1 · Maen Studios × Barkita</p><p style=\"position:absolute;right:128px;bottom:62px;width:120px;text-align:right;font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:24px;line-height:1.2\">12</p></section>"
